**iLead — AI Agent Knowledge Capture & Scaling:** Led the iLead initiative to address fragmented operational knowledge as a barrier to scaling enterprise AI adoption. Defined a repeatable framework to transform operational knowledge into reusable, AI-ready workflows, targeting a reduction in delivery effort from 28.5 hours to under six hours per workflow and increasing throughput from three to 14 workflows per designer per fortnight. Across 858 scenarios, the framework identifies potential annual productivity benefits of approximately 19,650 hours. This creates a scalable opportunity to reduce manual effort and rework, accelerate AI-agent deployment and release engineering capacity for higher-value activities, supporting Citi’s productivity, automation and cost-efficiency objectives.
